### Get all tickets
GET http://localhost:8082/api/tickets

### Get one existing ticket
GET http://localhost:8082/api/tickets/6a51e41521c1ecf8f0a0a40f

### Get one missing ticket
GET http://localhost:8081/api/tickets/000000000000000000000000

### Create a valid ticket (201 Created)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "VPN connection drops frequently",
  "description": "The secure global VPN disconnects automatically every 10 to 15 minutes while working remotely.",
  "category": "Network",
  "priority": "High",
  "createdBy": "Adam"
}

### Create an invalid ticket (400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "description": "",
  "category": "",
  "priority": "",
  "createdBy": ""
}